    "details": {
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>Lady Amara Grethry is an SSP assassin and hench-woman. She killed Gideon Rowan, mentor to a party member of the Order of the Argent Wolf. She takes pleasure in killing and has been consumed or dominated by the Soul Blade she wields. Sister Amara from the pre-Cataclysm records is a different person; any relationship remains unresolved. This is an initial playtest interpretation, notionally comparable to a level-14 Soul Blade warlock.</p>",
